n      border: 1px solid #555;\n      color: #444;\n      font-size: 8px;\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #f4f4f4 0, #f4f4f4 2px, #ddd 2px, #ddd 3px);\n    }\n    .photo {\n      width: 132px;\n      height: 46px;\n      margin: 0 0 4px 4px;\n      transform: rotate(-1deg);\n    }\n    .question {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n      margin: 3px 0;\n    }\n    .question .stem { text-indent: -15px; margin-left: 15px; }\n    .opts {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap: 15px;\n      margin-left: 15px;\n      padding-left: 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .opts span { display: block; }\n    .q17 .opts, .q18 .opts, .q21 .opts, .q22 .opts {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    }\n    .answer-imgs {\n      width: 282px;\n      margin: 3px 0 2px 3px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 5px 10px;\n    }\n    .answer-img {\n      position: relative;\n      height: 48px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(#e8e8e8 0 12px, transparent 12px),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, #f5f5f5 0 4px, #bbb 5px 6px);\n      border: 1px solid #777;\n      padding: 19px 4px 2px;\n      font-size: 7px;\n      color: #555;\n    }\n    .answer-img:after {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 1px;\n      right: 3px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    .answer-img.one:after { content: \"①\"; }\n    .answer-img.two:after { content: \"②\"; }\n    .answer-img.three:after { content: \"③\"; }\n    .answer-img.four:after { content: \"④\"; }\n    .tiny-building {\n      display: inline-block;\n      width: 42px;\n      height: 18px;\n      margin: 1px 6px;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n      border: 1px solid #777;\n      background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #ddd 0 5px, #999 5px 6px);\n    }\n    .answer-row {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      text-align: center;\n      word-spacing: 12px;\n      margin: 1px 0 3px;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 1;\n      left: 58px;\n      bottom: 17px;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 8px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"sheet\">\n    <div class=\"pencil top\"></div>\n    <div class=\"pencil bottom\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"top-line\">公众号：前途学科资料&nbsp;&nbsp;客服微信：yhs92</div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Historical photograph]</div>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A．秋收时节暮云愁，霹雳一声暴动</span>\n        <span>B．钟山风雨起苍黄，百万雄师过大江</span>\n        <span>C．红军不怕远征难，万水千山只等闲</span>\n        <span>D．雄鸡一唱天下白，峻岭神州展新颜</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">15．（2分）中国共产党历史上有一次重要会议是在与共产国际中断联系的情况下召开的，同时这次会议还是中国共产党历史上生死攸关的转折点。这次会议是（　）</div>\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A．中共三大</span><span>B．八七会议</span>\n        <span>C．遵义会议</span><span>D．中共七大</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">16．（2分）在武昌洪山峰逶的国民革命军第四军独立团官兵烈士墓中，安葬着1911位革命士兵。墓碑上镌刻着“精神不死　光照九重，主义之花　常闻香”。该材料反映的历史事件是（　）</div>\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A．武昌起义</span><span>B．黄花岗起义</span>\n        <span>C．北伐战争</span><span>D．武汉会战</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question q17\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">17．（2分）抗日战争爆发后，对国共两党合作抗日起到重要作用的事件是（　）</div>\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A．九一八事变</span><span>B．西安事变和平解决</span>\n        <span>C．八一三事变</span><span>D．黄埔军校建立</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question q18\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">18．（2分）2014年2月27日，十二届全国人大常委会通过决定，将每年的12月13日设立为国家公祭日。其公祭的对象是（　）</div>\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A．国民大革命死难者</span><span>B．抗日战争死难者</span>\n        <span>C．南京大屠杀死难者</span><span>D．解放战争死难者</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">19．（2分）毛泽东指出《双十协定》“第一次处是采取平等的方式，双方正式签订协定，这是历史上未有过的。”与此协定署相关的事件是（　）</div>\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A．国民党一大</span><span>B．中共七大</span>\n        <span>C．抗战胜利</span><span>D．重庆谈判</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">20．（2分）一位学生在综合实践活动中，收集了四张老照片的参观券，按其纪念的历史事件发生的先后顺序排列，正确的是（　）</div>\n\n      <div class=\"answer-imgs\">\n        <div class=\"answer-img two\">民国革命军北伐战争<br>纪念馆参观券</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-img one\">马克思主义在中国<br>早期传播纪念馆</div>\n        <div class=\"answer-img three\">黄埔军校旧址纪念馆<br><span class=\"tiny-building\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"answer-img four\">中国人民解放军<br>参观券 <span class=\"tiny-building\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"answer-row\">A．①②④③　 B．①④③②　 C．③②①④　 D．④①②③</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question q21\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">21．（2分）北平是一座历史文化名城，有众多遗迹。这些历史遗迹在解放战争中得以完整保存下来，主要得益于（　）</div>\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A．北平和谈</span><span>B．北平和平解放</span>\n        <span>C．南京解放</span><span>D．开国大典</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question q22\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">22．（2分）1949年，毛泽东向全世界宣告中华人民共和国成立的那一天是（　）</div>\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A．1月1日</span><span>B．7月1日</span>\n        <span>C．8月1日</span><span>D．10月1日</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">23．（2分）某历史学习小组围绕西藏和平解放、土地改革、抗美援朝进行研究</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">公众号：前途学科资料&nbsp;&nbsp;客服微信：yhs92</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
